  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of Fish Farming and Sales in Lake Ilopango, El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASALI will work with fishers around Lake Ilopango to improve and expand their aquaculture and facilitate sales. The project will directly benefit 112 fishers from associated cooperatives and other member groups and will indirectly benefit 560 other residents of the lake basin.</narrative>
